{"id":"podozrenie","lemma":"подозрение","pos":"noun","rank":4111,"glosses":["suspicion (act of suspecting something or someone, especially of something wrong)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"подозрения","plural":"подозрения"},"examples":[{"text":"Он попал под подозрение полиции.","en":"He fell under the suspicion of the police.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hit","l":"попасть"},{"g":"under, below, beneath"},null,{"g":"police","l":"полиция"}]},{"text":"Никто не был вне подозрения.","en":"No one was above suspicion.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"out of, outside"},null]},{"text":"Новости подтвердили мои подозрения.","en":"The news confirmed my suspicions.","words":[{"g":"news"},{"g":"to confirm","l":"подтвердить"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"У меня были свои подозрения.","en":"I had my suspicions.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Его поведение возбудило во мне подозрение.","en":"His behavior aroused my suspicions.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"conduct, behaviour"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]}]}